  "description": "CR 506.4 whole cards: attacked as a planeswalker, a Siege whose protector changes is removed from combat",
  "note": "Three seats, CR 507.1's single defender (attackOption null). alice's Invasion of Dominaria, carol protecting it, is made a 5/5 artifact creature (Liquimetal Coating, Skilled Animator) and a planeswalker (Planeswalkerificate). bob chooses alice to defend, so the Elf can attack the Siege only as a planeswalker. bob then casts Synthetic Shifting Allegiance and becomes its protector (CR 310.9f): the protector changed, so the Siege is removed from combat (CR 506.4), the spell's second sentence does not find the Elf, and the Elf, attacking nothing (CR 506.4c), takes nothing off its defense. The --control file has carol, already its protector, cast the same spell: the Elf is exiled.",
